  "title": "Tagger denies Shi from 4-2 down in decider to reach Guangzhou semis",
  "description": "No. 4 seed Lilli Tagger came from 4-2 down in the third set to defeat wild card Shi Han 6-4, 3-6, 7-5 in 2 hours and 38 minutes in the Guangzhou Open quarterfinals, converting her second match point to reach her third career tour-level semifinal. The 18-year-old Austrian joins 16-year-old Sun Xinran in the last four -- they are the youngest pair of WTA semifinalists at a single tournament (in terms of combined age) since 17-year-olds Olga Danilovic and Anastasia Potapova met in the 2018 Moscow River Cup final.",
